--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
2. STAR Methods / Cell Press compatibility profile
   The STAR Methods interoperability profile under
   inst/extdata/profiles/star-methods/ contains only independently written
   mapping and validation rules (GPL-3, as part of this package). No Cell Press
   or STAR Methods workbook, template, logo, or branded text is bundled. Users
   who wish to fill an official STAR template must supply their own copy.

